13 year old athlete :) Dancer, Cheerleader, Gymnast, Volleyball player, Basketball player, Soccer player, Football player. Attends Page School...not enjoying it..and loves her hubby colty...hmmmm what elsee... well Kia is her name and im her publishist...Kia is more than a tripple threat...wants to be a lawyer, teacher, doctor, or stay at home mom ...wants two kids a great hubby (which she already soon to be has) lol well kia wants a nice house nice car nice family...Two Kids : One boy named Cason Trace Bradley another boy named Caden Keith Bradley..hmm and two girls...no names YET...well thats basically her life...for now hope u had fun looking up Kia on wikipedia.org....now go look up someone else

===Determiner===
'''kia''' (''plural'' '''[[kiaj]]''', ''accusative singular'' '''[[kian]]''', ''accusative plural'' '''[[kiajn]]''')

# what kind of, which kind of (the interrogative and relative correlative of kind)

Kia is awesome beyond awesome ...so awesome she is da bombbbb....and yea dont forget that homieee

===Usage notes===
Like other interrogative and relative correlatives, '''kia''' can be combined with ''[[ajn]]'', the adverbial particle of generality. '''''Kia''' ajn'' thus means ''whatever kind of''.

